  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 5 year rows (昭和 10-14, 年末) + 47 prefectures + 5 colonial rows (朝鮮, 臺灣, 樺太, 關東州, 南洋群島) = 52 rows. 〃 expanded to 昭和. Unit 人 printed above the first figure of 職員 columns and 巡查一人ニ付人口. Headed 內地累年 / 內地、外地別 (昭和十四年末).",
   "Footnote marks are printed beside the figure/label and kept in the cell/label: '(1)' before 朝鮮, 臺灣, 樺太, 南洋群島 (昭和十三年末現在); '(2)' before 臺灣 巡查 8,850; '(3)' before 關東州 巡查 1,328; '(4)' before 南洋群島 警察署 6; '(5)' before 南洋群島 巡查 159. 朝鮮 and 關東州 巡查部長 printed '…'.",
   "昭和 13, 警部補巡查部長及巡查派出所: printed '47,57' (comma misplaced; neighbouring years are 4,6xx-4,7xx); kept as printed, not corrected.",
   "Chapter heading printed above the table: 11. 警察、衛生及災害 (the leaf p0100 right page begins chapter 11; table 143 on the left page belongs to the preceding chapter).",
   "Checks: in all 57 rows 職員 總數 = 警察部長 + 警視 + 警部 + 警部補 + 巡查部長 + 巡查 (reconciles; 朝鮮 巡查部長 '…' counted as 0). The 47 prefectures sum, in every column, exactly to the printed 昭和 14 row (1,206 / 16 / 4,774 / 14,277 / 75,443 / 52 / 434 / 1,818 / 4,686 / 9,730 / 58,723); the 昭和 13 派出所 figure 47,57 is unaffected."
  ],
